Bugfix: Name the upload cancel button

The button that aborts a running upload is an icon-only input of type button with
an empty value. For that element type the value attribute is the accessible name,
so the control was announced as an unnamed button while being visible, focusable
and operable during every upload. It now carries an aria-label, at both places
where the markup exists: the logged-in file list and the public upload view.

WCAG 2.1 AA, SC 4.1.2
